{"You can’t. The line was cut years ago. I’ll call you.": [0.0, 3.691], "Can you see the harbor from your window?": [4.091, 2.816], "Count the boats. There should be thirty one. There are never thirty one.": [7.307, 4.075], "It’s there. Under the fog. It’s always there.": [11.781, 3.2], "Then you’re not looking hard enough.": [15.381, 2.496], "Do you hear a bell out on the water?": [18.277, 2.539], "Don’t go down to it. Whatever you do.": [21.216, 2.965], "Listen. Between the waves.": [24.581, 2.283], "Everyone hears it eventually.": [27.264, 2.56], "Will you stay away from the water tonight?": [30.224, 2.752], "Good. Promise me.": [33.376, 1.877], "Then wear a coat. It’s cold down there.": [35.653, 2.965], "The water heard that.": [39.019, 1.664], "Do you know who I am?": [41.083, 1.749], "Then don’t say my name. Names carry in the fog.": [43.232, 3.456], "Good. It’s safer that way.": [47.088, 2.283], "You’ll remember. Everyone remembers at three twelve.": [49.771, 3.627], "Do you think I’m still alive?": [53.797, 2.176], "That’s kind of you.": [56.373, 1.344], "Neither do I.": [58.117, 1.472], "That’s the honest answer.": [59.989, 2.027], "Would you come and find me, if you could?": [62.416, 2.816], "Follow the bells. Not tonight.": [65.632, 2.56], "I understand. I wouldn’t either.": [68.592, 2.731], "I’ll leave the porch light on.": [71.723, 2.389], "Is the clock on your wall still stopped at three twelve?": [74.512, 3.627], "Then nothing has changed. Good.": [78.539, 2.539], "Look again.": [81.477, 1.045], "It is. It always is.": [82.923, 2.368], "Do you want time to start again?": [85.691, 2.624], "Be careful. When it starts, it doesn’t stop.": [88.715, 3.179], "Neither do I. Three twelve is safe.": [92.293, 3.136], "That’s what the keeper said.": [95.829, 2.133], "Will you wind it for me?": [98.363, 2.283], "Not yet. Not tonight.": [101.045, 2.24], "Then it will stay three twelve forever.": [103.685, 2.88], "The key is lost anyway.": [106.965, 2.432], "Has anything knocked yet tonight?": [109.797, 2.731], "Did you answer it?": [112.928, 1.408], "It will.": [114.736, 0.954], "If you’re not sure, it did.": [116.09, 2.304], "Are you going to open the door if it knocks again?": [118.794, 3.392], "Please don’t.": [122.586, 1.195], "Good. Keep the latch on.": [124.181, 2.176], "Maybe is how the keeper started.": [126.757, 2.731], "Is someone standing outside right now?": [129.888, 3.2], "Don’t look. Just listen.": [133.488, 2.027], "Then who is breathing on the glass?": [135.914, 2.453], "Check the window. Slowly.": [138.768, 2.389], "Is this the Calloway house?": [141.557, 2.112], "Then tell Ruth I’m still waiting by the phone.": [144.069, 3.349], "Then why did you pick up?": [147.818, 1.899], "It used to be.": [150.117, 1.493], "Is Ruth there with you?": [152.01, 2.048], "Put her on. Please.": [154.458, 1.813], "She never is. Not anymore.": [156.672, 2.624], "Ask the radio. She might be.": [159.696, 2.603], "Will you tell her I called?": [162.698, 2.219], "Thank you. Tell her it’s me.": [165.317, 2.475], "Then I’ll keep calling.": [168.192, 2.155], "She always said maybe.": [170.746, 2.027], "Have you ever seen the lighthouse lit?": [173.173, 2.688], "Then you saw him. The keeper.": [176.261, 2.432], "Nobody has, since the Hollowtide.": [179.093, 3.029], "You’d remember the light.": [182.522, 1.813], "Do you want to see it lit again?": [184.736, 2.368], "Then put your lantern in the window.": [187.504, 2.731], "Good. When it’s lit, the knocking starts.": [190.634, 2.88], "It heard you.": [193.914, 1.195], "Will you keep your lantern burning tonight?": [195.509, 2.901], "Thank you. They need a light to find their way.": [198.81, 3.093], "Then the dark is yours.": [202.304, 2.155], "Keep it low, then.": [204.858, 2.005], "Do you dream about the water?": [207.264, 2.347], "So do I. Every night.": [210.01, 2.261], "You will, after tonight.": [212.672, 2.24], "Are the boats in your dream?": [215.312, 2.347], "Thirty one of them.": [218.058, 2.005], "Then you haven’t looked far enough out.": [220.464, 2.56], "They’re always there. Behind the fog.": [223.424, 2.901], "Do you want to wake up?": [226.725, 1.429], "Then don’t fall asleep near the radio.": [228.554, 3.136], "Then stay. It’s quiet here.": [232.09, 2.432], "Nobody here is sure if they’re awake.": [234.922, 2.859], "Does the terminal still tell you it knows everything?": [238.181, 3.605], "It doesn’t. The two before it knew more.": [242.186, 3.008], "Ask it. It loves to say so.": [245.594, 2.837], "It says it to everyone.": [248.832, 2.219], "Do you trust it?": [251.45, 1.216], "Then be careful what you ask.": [253.066, 2.176], "Good. It keeps secrets.": [255.642, 2.155], "That’s wise.": [258.197, 1.173], "Has it ever asked you a question?": [259.77, 2.688], "Don’t answer it.": [262.858, 1.259], "It will. At three twelve.": [264.517, 2.389], "Then it already has.": [267.306, 1.664]}